It’s time to unstuff my May savings challenges and see how much I was able to save this month! 💰 In today’s cash stuffing video, I’m counting all of my challenge savings, reallocating cash into my sinking funds, and sharing my progress as a single mom budgeting on a semi-monthly income.

If you enjoy cash stuffing, budgeting, sinking funds, savings challenges, and realistic single mom finances, you’re in the right place! ✨

In this video:

May savings challenge unstuffing
Cash counting & money reallocation
Sinking funds update
Single mom budgeting motivation
Realistic savings journey

